  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$f(x)=\\sin ^{-1}\\left(\\log _3\\left(\\frac{x}{3}\\right)\\right)$ exists if\n$-1 \\leq \\log _3\\left(\\frac{x}{3}\\right) \\leq 1 \\Leftrightarrow 3^{-1} \\leq \\frac{x}{3} \\leq 3^1 \\Leftrightarrow 1 \\leq x \\leq 9$ or $x \\in[1,9]$"
  }
